<h1>RESTful API Documentation — TO-DO-TRACKER</h1>
<p><strong>Course:</strong> BACSE344 — Cloud Infrastructure and Architecture | <strong>Slot:</strong> C1 | <strong>Faculty:</strong> Dr. P. Anandan<br>
<strong>Student Name:</strong> ANIKET MOHANTY | <strong>Registration Number:</strong> 25BCE5816<br>
<strong>Production Base URL:</strong> <code>https://taskflow-backend-9huw.onrender.com/api</code></p>

<h2>1. Overview & Authentication</h2>
<p>The TO-DO-TRACKER API is a stateless RESTful interface communicating over HTTPS/TLS 1.3 with JSON payloads. Protected endpoints enforce multi-tenant isolation via cryptographic JSON Web Tokens (JWT) passed in the HTTP Authorization header:</p>
<pre>Authorization: Bearer &lt;jwt_token&gt;</pre>

<h2>2. Complete API Endpoint Summary Table</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 12%;">Method</th>
      <th style="width: 32%;">Endpoint Path</th>
      <th style="width: 38%;">Functionality / Description</th>
      <th style="width: 18%;">Auth Required</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/health</code></td><td>Monitors server uptime and live MongoDB Atlas connection</td><td>No (Public)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/auth/register</code></td><td>Registers user with bcrypt password hashing (12 rounds) & returns JWT</td><td>No (Public)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/auth/login</code></td><td>Authenticates credentials and returns signed JWT token</td><td>No (Public)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/auth/me</code></td><td>Returns authenticated user profile information</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/habits</code></td><td>Lists all active habit tasks for the logged-in user</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/habits</code></td><td>Creates a new fixed or variable recurring habit task</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-put">PUT</span></td><td><code>/api/habits/:id</code></td><td>Updates habit name, type, scheduled days, or color</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-patch">PATCH</span></td><td><code>/api/habits/:id/order</code></td><td>Updates custom sequential ordering of habits</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/api/habits/:id</code></td><td>Soft-deletes habit (isActive: false) to preserve historical data</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/completions</code></td><td>Retrieves completed checkmarks for the user's habits in a month</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/completions/chart</code></td><td>Computes 30-day percentage completion time-series for SVG chart</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/completions/toggle</code></td><td>Atomically toggles completion status for habit on a specific date</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/completions/streak/:id</code></td><td>Calculates current consecutive day streak for a habit</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/tasks</code></td><td>Lists Kanban tasks with server-side filtering, sorting & pagination</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/tasks</code></td><td>Creates a new Kanban task item</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/tasks/:id</code></td><td>Retrieves single task details (ownership verified)</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-put">PUT</span></td><td><code>/api/tasks/:id</code></td><td>Full update of task title, description, priority, and due date</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-patch">PATCH</span></td><td><code>/api/tasks/:id</code></td><td>Partial status update (todo ➔ in-progress ➔ completed)</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/api/tasks/:id</code></td><td>Deletes a specific Kanban task</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><span class="badge-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/tasks/stats</code></td><td>Aggregation pipeline calculating total, overdue, and status counts</td><td>Yes (Bearer)</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>3. Sample API Requests & Responses</h2>

<h3>3.1 POST /api/auth/register (User Registration)</h3>
<p><strong>Request Body:</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "name": "Aniket Mohanty",
  "email": "aniket@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}</pre>
<p><strong>Response (201 Created):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Account created successfully!",
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
  "user": {
    "id": "6aa44de754b6ef26c89ed5c4",
    "name": "Aniket Mohanty",
    "email": "aniket@example.com"
  }
}</pre>

<h3>3.2 POST /api/habits (Create Recurring Habit)</h3>
<p><strong>Request Body:</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "name": "Cloud Computing Lab",
  "type": "variable",
  "scheduledDays": [1, 3, 5],
  "color": "#34d399"
}</pre>
<p><strong>Response (201 Created):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Habit task created",
  "data": {
    "_id": "6aa4534aaf80b1f1f0e0df42",
    "name": "Cloud Computing Lab",
    "type": "variable",
    "scheduledDays": [1, 3, 5],
    "color": "#34d399",
    "order": 0,
    "userId": "6aa44de754b6ef26c89ed5c4",
    "isActive": true
  }
}</pre>

<h3>3.3 POST /api/completions/toggle (Atomic Checkbox Toggle)</h3>
<p><strong>Request Body:</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "taskId": "6aa4534aaf80b1f1f0e0df42",
  "date": "2026-09-13"
}</pre>
<p><strong>Response (200 OK):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "_id": "6aa511bc...",
    "taskId": "6aa4534aaf80b1f1f0e0df42",
    "date": "2026-09-13",
    "completed": true,
    "userId": "6aa44de754b6ef26c89ed5c4"
  }
}</pre>

<h3>3.4 GET /api/tasks/stats (Dashboard Analytics Pipeline)</h3>
<p><strong>Response (200 OK):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "total": 12,
    "overdue": 1,
    "byStatus": { "todo": 4, "in-progress": 3, "completed": 5 },
    "byPriority": { "low": 2, "medium": 6, "high": 4 },
    "completionRate": "41.7"
  }
}</pre>

